@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Registro (usar datos de prueba propios; no requiere permisos administrativos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Nombre","lastName":"Prueba","email":"prueba@example.com","password":"Cambiar-esta-clave-123","confirmPassword":"Cambiar-esta-clave-123"}

### Login: copiar accessToken de la respuesta en la variable token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"prueba@example.com","password":"Cambiar-esta-clave-123"}

### Perfil propio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Catálogo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/events?city=Lima&page=1&pageSize=20

### Categorías activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/categories
